  "predecessor": {
    "directory": ".upstream/artifacts/date-picker-render-hooks-source-v1/",
    "failedFirstCSR": "Preserved unchanged. Actual Tab closes popup; the next visible-cell locator timed out. v2 adds an explicit actual input reopen before the next cell click. No observer views or serializer changed.",
    "newBoundedObservation": "Only two additional datetime actions replace one public showTime prop with authored {format:HH:mm}, omitting showXXX/steps/use12Hours; outer input format and model stay unchanged. Full actual info.locale remains unmodified."
  },
  "caller": {
    "API": "Only public DatePicker and DatePicker.RangePicker with controlled stable authored Dayjs value(s)/open, format/showTime/showNow/needConfirm, stable public disabledDate/disabledTime, ordinary callbacks and cellRender/panelRender/renderExtraFooter. No mode/picker/multiple/week/quarter API, deprecated dateRender/monthCellRender/addon, Native import or expected data.",
    "state": "Four fresh owners/pages. No StrictMode. Controlled onChange records actual arguments and leaves authored model references stable. Hooks start omitted for a fresh baseline; authored DOM button.click inside ReactDOM.flushSync changes only declared hook props/state. Controls are typebutton/tabindex-1 so keyboard traversal observes actual picker/returned content. No private state or render hook is invoked by the collector.",
    "renderers": "Each actual cell call keeps current/full info/default origin element and return snapshots, own-key order/descriptors, actual receiver/arity, today/locale/current/origin identities and return-child alias relations. Wrapped/replace content is authored SPAN; replacement never includes origin or a fallback button. Panel wrap retains the actual origin as child plus a typebutton; replacement/empty omits origin. Footer receives actual mode and returns an authored element/empty React.Fragment, plus Source-only absence/null/false/empty string/0 observations in single-date.",
    "clock": "CSR explicitly uses Playwright clock.setFixedTime for Date only with real timers/RAF. Initial fixedDate is June10 2024 08:23:45.678 UTC. One declared advance to June11 09:24:46.789 plus a real owner repaint swaps only cellRender identity with the same output; actual per-panel today values/aliases are captured. Another repaint while closed then real input reopen observes the retained-popup boundary.",
    "forms": "Ordinary owner form records actual submit and prevents navigation. All authored controls/rendered buttons explicitly typebutton. Source popup uses its standard body portal; no form reparenting, nested library button, forced tabindex on Source cells or fake native control methods.",
    "filters": "Each owner also has an interactive-cell phase and actual pointer click plus keyboard.type for one custom cell input and the custom panel/footer inputs; only the cell input click stops propagation. Its authored width20px/boxSizingborder-box keeps its real hit target inside the cell; calendar target is exact2024-06-18, not day-of-month duplicates. Single-date additionally changes only public needConfirm=true with showNowtrue, observing the actual Today label alongside OK. The only restrictions are disabled calendar day14 (type=date) and datetime minute0 with hideDisabledOptionsfalse. Real disabled/enabled custom SPAN clicks are observed; no expected selection callback count/argument is authored.",
    "SSR": "Initial CLOSED owner only, with all three public renderers supplied through the same factory initial state. This differs explicitly from CSR no-hook baseline. Each renderToString/renderToStaticMarkup has a fresh DOM-free VM. Real hook rows/refs/resources/HTML retained; hooks are never invoked to construct expected nodes. SSR uses real VM Date; no today argument is invented when a hook is idle."
  },
