  "observation": {
    "hookTape": "Every whole hook observation is retained exactly once in per-action delta parts, with a monotonic cursor. No quadratic copying of the complete history into each point. Hook counts are actual diagnostics, never pre-authored expected callback multiplicity.",
    "graphBoundary": "All public argument/return own keys, descriptors, props/children and aliases retained. DOM/ambient Window are declared leaves. Private ReactElement._owner is opaque in BOTH encoded and raw views with identity/own surface retained; private Fiber values are outside scope. No prototype patches, getters shims, fake React elements or original node mutation.",
    "DOM": "Whole owner/popup HTML and complete explicitly scoped element surfaces: attributes, child node types/order, selectedCSS, rectangles, input/focus/caret/ref identities, calendar/time cells, panel/Range wrappers and footer/extra/ranges parents/buttons. No all-page/all-property CSS or CDP AX inventory.",
    "keyboard": "At full SPAN replacement actual input click followed by Tab,Tab,Shift+Tab,Shift+Tab records physical targets. No required Source cell tab stops or Source keyboard selection is inferred. Existing Native full-button origin is a separate accepted Snippet representation; custom replacement owns its interactive markup.",
    "emptyMapping": "Primary empty renderers return React.Fragment, the explicit analogue of an empty Native Snippet body. Source callback absence/null/false/empty string/0 are extra observations, not invented Native Snippet return values or DOM-emptiness probes.",
    "lifecycle": "Actual controlled close+1000 per owner, closed callback-prop repaint, input reopen, real unmount/frame drain/cleanup and late1000. Hidden DOM is explicitly zero-or-stale; no assumed global resource zero. Per-key observations are actual frame reads, not full settled snapshots.",
    "storage": "Whole raw point and whole hook delta each written separately as original JSON and lossless gzip with both sizes/SHA. First/repeat separate fresh CSR processes; first/repeat separate fresh SSR processes. Original IDs/timestamps/failed attempts immutable, no normalization. Frozen input pins reverified after each run.",
    "limits": "Bounded hook counter for existing supported Single/Range date/datetime and navigable date/month/year/decade panels, not a generic framework, supported picker/multiple expansion, hydration/production test or claim of whole React/Svelte DOM equivalence."
